{"server":"cn","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_03_beg","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_03","title":"音乐室内的光芒","storyCode":"SS-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a80d4bcfd705f7ff8f4172205fda274a91d90cda5edd5cb6d308cfae36b2ba1c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g10_dreamcastlestage"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"犯人48038，出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"长官，您有什么吩咐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"检查个人物品，有没有遗漏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有，东西我都带齐了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沿着走廊往前面走，走到尽头的那个小窗，签个字离开就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的，谢谢长官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有力的小跑声在长廊上回荡。\n而沉闷的皮靴声则一点点向走廊的最深处靠近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"海铃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"滚吧，今年别让我再看到你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海铃熟练地拿起自己的琴盒，慢悠悠地走出了监狱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"narration","text":"叙拉古还是和从前一样，用连绵的小雨迎接她的回归。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这条街，还有前后两条街，每家店都派人盯着，绝对不能让她跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥，北街那边传来消息，她朝这边过来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盯紧她，别让她跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她好像没有要躲的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......让其他人都聚过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"narration","text":"狭窄的胡同里，一群凶神恶煞的打手，正将提着琴盒的少女团团围住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又见面了......海铃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我一开始还在想，你这种高手，怎么没有一个家族把你纳入麾下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们家族遭难后，四处打听，才知道你原来是个臭名昭著的“叛徒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你前后换过十几个名字，在各个家族间来回接活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的合同里没有写我不能替别人干活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我早就说过——我只是拿人钱财，替人消灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就把我们的机密告诉了对家？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不懂你在说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥伦比亚粗口*，别装傻了！自从你来过后，我们的人就不断遭到暗算！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亏我和老大当时那么信任你，还邀请你加入我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗朗西斯，我不记得我有做过什么对不起你们的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，是你亏欠的人实在太多，想都想不起来了吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大死了，大家都死了，几百号人现在只剩我们十几个了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一帮兄弟好不容易从哥伦比亚漂泊到这鬼地方，全栽在你一个人手上了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别跟她废话了，我们这么多人在这，今天必须给她个教训！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想和你们起冲突......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"虽然海铃努力想要通过言语平息冲突，但对方逼近的脚步没有丝毫停下的意思——\n她不得不放下了拿在手上的琴盒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人......跟我上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的老妇人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，不要再往前走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的老妇人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那边刚发生了点事，你一个人去不安全。赶紧绕路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴着帽子的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢提醒。"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女并没有理会路人的劝告，而是朝她说的方向继续走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"narration","text":"雨淅淅沥沥地下着，冲刷着叙拉古的一切。\n少女走进小巷，这里干干净净，仿佛是刚建好一样，一尘不染。\n叙拉古的清洁工总是这么专业。\n潮湿的空气中，闻不到一丝血的气味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海铃......你在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在......找海铃吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"narration","text":"一座娱乐场里的台球室。没有人会想到，有人将它当作自己的住所。\n几个纸箱简单地拼成了一张床，最基本的生活用品全被塞进了快餐店赠送的袋子里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"台球桌上摆满了信封，里面装着海铃的酬劳。\n海铃一一拆开这些信封，将里面的金币随手扔在桌上，一枚枚印刻着“家族”“秩序”的金币很快堆成了一座小山。\n这些金币就这样被随意地放在毫无保护的地方，就算丢了，她也一点都不会心疼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海铃再次确认了一遍——这封信里什么都没有。\n她将信封翻了过来，上面印着一枚家族徽记，还有一个寄件地址。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，她来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"监狱里的那些人，没找你麻烦吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是老熟人了，更何况，他们都知道我背后的雇主是谁，何必找不痛快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过老爷特地把我叫来，恐怕不只是为了问我这种小事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，就是单纯关心一下合作伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，我们什么时候成合作伙伴了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之前签订合同时，你甚至不愿意以你家族的名义委托我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然想成为“合作伙伴”，从现在起当然要开诚布公——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海铃，我想和你做笔长期生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么生意必须当面谈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想——邀请你加入我的家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说......什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里面没人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明那么怕她，为什么还要跟过来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是家族成员，当然不懂！我必须......替大家报仇雪恨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们和海铃之间到底发生过什么事，她那么不可饶恕吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果经历过这种“背叛”，一定也不会原谅她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们家族大部分成员都是从哥伦比亚拓荒区逃难至此的普通人，缺少人脉和资源，所以经常会遭到各种本地帮派的挤对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种情况持续了很多年，直到有一天，老大花重金请来了一个打手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人是海铃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。雇佣她以后，我们度过了很长一段时间的安稳日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那段日子真的很美好，再也不用担心据点突然被人偷袭，也不用担心有人上门来找麻烦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们邀请她加入我们家族时，她却拒绝了，而且第二天她整个人还直接消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正当我们觉得疑惑的时候，不知道谁引来的对家打手，偷袭了我们的据点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那场面我至今都不愿回想......实在太惨了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得是海铃出卖了你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了她还能是谁，哪有这么巧合的事情？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不相信海铃会做出这种背信弃义的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识的海铃，和你说的一样，能力强大，令人安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且会对自己加入的组织尽职尽责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，事实就摆在我面前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有在那帮偷袭你的人中，看见她的身影吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你还记得那些偷袭者的面貌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一辈子都忘不了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子深吸了一口气，将手伸向了口袋里的防身武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......是有人故意离间你们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......是有人一直在监视海铃呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你这是什么意思？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"弗朗西斯还没反应过来，四周的柜门突然全部被推开。\n每个柜子里都站着一个身形魁梧的打手，他们手里拿着武器，一齐指向房间中央的两人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的打手们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不许动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
